<scheme version="2.0" title="Polynomial Regression - Wine Quality - Red Wine" description="Official Orange catalogue data; quality is numeric target. Multivariate polynomial features d=2 and d=3, deterministic 70/30 holdout (Orange RandomSeed=42), ordinary Linear Regression.">
